Context()->texStrings;
BEGIN_TEXT
You may give a decimal answer rounded to two decimal places or an exact value. $BR 
Computing the outward flux of \( F(x,y,z)=(xyz,xyz,xyz) \) over five sides of the cube \( 0 \leq x,y,z \leq 1 \) excluding the \( z=0 \) side is a long computation which you completed in an earlier worksheet.  Now compute the same outward flux by "moving the surface integral" to the \( z=0 \) side of the cube.
$BR
\{$q1->ans_rule\}

END_TEXT
Context()->normalStrings;

##############################################################
#
#  Answers
#
#

ANS($q1->with(tolerance=>.02)->cmp);


# default tolerance is .01 or one percent.


